desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "检测到双向控制字符"
	title_zh: "检测到双向控制字符",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-no-bidi-characters"
	risk: "unicode-direction-control"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
该规则用于检测 双向控制字符 相关的风险模式，属于 Unicode 双向控制字符 类问题。

### 风险类型
Unicode 双向控制字符（unicode-direction-control）

### 影响
源码中隐藏双向控制字符，可能使显示内容与真实执行逻辑不一致，形成混淆攻击。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-837
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
移除隐藏 Unicode 控制字符，并使用可显示隐藏字符的编辑器审查源码。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sol": <<<POS
‪

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/‪/) as $p0
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/‫/) as $p1
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/‭/) as $p2
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/‮/) as $p3
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/⁦/) as $p4
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/⁧/) as $p5
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/⁨/) as $p6
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/‬/) as $p7
${*.sol}.pattern_regex(/⁩/) as $p8
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 + $p4 + $p5 + $p6 + $p7 + $p8 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "检测到双向控制字符",
	title_zh: "检测到双向控制字符",
	message: "检测到双向控制字符",
}
